# A computed regular expression in `trim` that does not compile is DS4004 when the query runs.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| project t = trim(strcat('[', 'a'), orderId)
---- expected
error[DS4004]: `[a` is not a valid regular expression
  --> query:2:15
  |
2 | | project t = trim(strcat('[', 'a'), orderId)
  |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ in this call of `trim`
  |
  = note: unclosed character class (regexes use Rust `regex` syntax)
